`});var aB,xZ,_Z,sB,cB=ue(()=>{du();aB=Object.freeze([["informationGain","Information gained per action","higher_is_better"],["contradictionCost","Contradiction-resolution cost","lower_is_better"],["duplicateWork","Duplicate work avoided","higher_is_better"],["uncertaintyCalibration","Uncertainty calibration error","lower_is_better"],["heldOutFamily","Held-out protein-family performance","higher_is_better"]]),xZ=()=>aB.map(([e,t,o])=>`
